OL,3,GNEWSACouncil complains about noise from
OL,4,Awedding venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parish council has complained about
OL,7,Fthe levels of noise and disturbance
OL,8,Ffrom a wedding venue.
OL,10,FThe Barn, near Luton, Bedfordshire,
OL,11,Fholds a licence from North Herts
OL,12,FCouncil that allows it to stay open
OL,13,Funtil 01:30 on weekends and can provide
OL,14,Falcohol and late-night refreshments
OL,15,Funtil 01:00.
OL,17,FOffley Parish Council has made a number
OL,18,Fof claims against the venue, including
OL,19,Fthat fireworks were being let off
OL,20,Fwithin the car park and on the
OL,21,Fsurrounding village green, and it also
OL,22,Fraised parking issues.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
