OL,3,GNEWSACouncil complains about noise from
OL,4,Awedding venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Barn told the BBC that a majority
OL,7,Fof its events conclude by 23:00, that
OL,8,Fit rarely operates until midnight, and
OL,9,Fit has invested in acoustic
OL,10,Fsoundproofing.
